Summary:
Today’s session involved preparing the project synopsis report for the Multi-Vendor E-commerce Platform. The focus was on organizing all the analyzed requirements into a structured document by covering sections such as abstract, problem statement, objectives, modules, and proposed system. Each part was written to clearly represent the project idea and its workflow in a simple and understandable manner. The synopsis was aligned with the given format and guidelines for submission.

Outcomes:
A complete draft of the project synopsis was successfully prepared. The project structure, key features, and modules were clearly documented, ensuring clarity of the overall system. This step ensured readiness for submission within the deadline. It also provided a solid reference for moving into the design and development phases.
